 gray:"A 25 year old woman presents with a generalized headache for 6 months, aggravated by her sleep deprivation, stress, menstrual period, sometimes nausea but no vomit and photophobia. What is the most likely diagnosis? — 1. Chronic migraine 2. Tension type headache 3. Hypertension-related headache 4. Cluster headache 5. Menstrual headache",
